MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C_001: What's up, Priesty? You need somethin' from the\ngreat Majide?
MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C_002: It's a matter of the utmost importance—one that\nconcerns your very soul.
MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C_003: Huh? Whaddaya mean?
MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C_004: I've heard a troubling rumor that you've been on\nthe prowl for those who possess flamma.
MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C_005: Ah, yeah! I've been finding every guy who's got\nsome of that stuff and punching 'em good!
MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C_006: Haven't really gotten much though. Too bad.\nDrinking flamma's real good for a strength boost.
MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C_007: You mustn't drink it! Flamma will lead to the\ncorruption of your entire being!
MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C_008: Heh. C'mon, Priesty. Back off, OK? I'm part\nof the good guys here.
MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C_009: Anyone who's got some of this stuff has gotta be\nbad news.
MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C_010: Yeah, I'm just doing my part! I can sniff out a\ncrook's stink easy. Haha!
MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C_011: Please, Majide. Don't seek out flamma.
MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C_012: It's an abomination—a deadly poison that grants\nstrength but devours your soul.
MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C_013: Huh? I don't get ya. That stuff is amazing!
MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C_014: My words don't seem to be reaching you. So you\nleave me with no choice...
MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C_015: I...I can't purify you? But why? It's...it's like you\naren't suffering from its corruption at all.
MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C_016: Hey, what's the big idea? Why you gettin' all grabby?
MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C_017: J-just to clarify, Majide... You have taken flamma,\nhaven't you?
MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C_018: Uh, yeah. So?
MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C_019: It's beyond belief, but your body seems to shrug off\nthe awful effects.
MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C_020: Sounds about right! I'm not your usual guy. I can\nchug it down no problem.
MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C_021: Chug?! No, no—no matter what, you still must not\nconsume it.
MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C_022: Huh? I'm gonna ask again—why not? I mean, it's\nnot hurtin' me at all!
MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C_023: Aw, how can I explain any of this to someone\nwho hasn't seen its dark side... Oh, yes!
MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C_024: Majide! You're unbelievably strong even without\nflamma, aren't you?
MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C_025: Huh? Well, yeah.
MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C_026: You can fight pretty much anyone, right? Despite\nhaving no godly blood, or even proper training?
MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C_027: I mean to say...you are amazing the way you are!\nYour soul is a wonder as it is!
MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C_028: Priesty! I didn't know you got me!
MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C_029: You're right though. I'm the strongest around!\nSo, yeah, who needs that junk?
MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C_030: Exactly! Look at you, figuring it all out! But please,\ndon't forget our little chat here, OK?
MID_SE_Orh_Maj_C_031: Phew! Got through to him...somehow.